Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 18:34:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/23] Filter 'each of those <type> you (don't) control'
 tracked sets by controller

Lost in the Maze: 'Put a stun counter on each of those creatures you don't
control' now folds the controller scope into TrackedSetFiltered instead of
collapsing to a bare TrackedSet. CR 608.2c.

Anchors: Stall for Time, Monstrosity of the Lake, Hapatra, the Desert Frost.
Co-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
